# Build artefacts for both crates, and what scripts/build-runtime.sh generates
# from the ZIPP release the installed Softn release names: the guest wasm the
# launcher's build.rs embeds, and the guest's Cargo.lock (seeded from ZIPP's own
# lock on every build). The launchers land in backend/bin/runtime/, which is
# ignored too; host/SOURCE.json was the hand-kept provenance they replaced
# (backend/bin/runtime/SOURCE.json is generated) — see README.md.
target/
**/target/
/host/formlogic-runtime-guest.wasm
/host/SOURCE.json
/guest/Cargo.lock
